    {
      "id": "lvVhcQM5Vdxf7KnSAj_md",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4166.866568252317,
      "y": 3519.753684100468,
      "width": 1100.83935546875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b04",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1841398376,
      "version": 184,
      "versionNonce": 488445178,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791742684901,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The first think which i run the kubectl commmand  \n\nkubectl  apply -f deployment.yaml\n\nwhat happend here : kubectl sends the Deployment Objc (not the Pod) as an HTTPS request to kube-apiserver. \nthe first time  i apply if (means the object doesn't exist yet): kubectl sends a POST with the full Deployment\nas JSON.\nEvery apply after that (means the object already exists) : kubectl computes the diff and sends  a PATCH the \nstrategic-merge-atch or apply-patch we coverd, not the whole object again. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The first think which i run the kubectl commmand  \n\nkubectl  apply -f deployment.yaml\n\nwhat happend here : kubectl sends the Deployment Objc (not the Pod) as an HTTPS request to kube-apiserver. \nthe first time  i apply if (means the object doesn't exist yet): kubectl sends a POST with the full Deployment\nas JSON.\nEvery apply after that (means the object already exists) : kubectl computes the diff and sends  a PATCH the \nstrategic-merge-atch or apply-patch we coverd, not the whole object again. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
